\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 * Task-6 [Finding and removing duplicate observations]:
\par 
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 * Identify Duplicate Cases.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 SORT CASES BY student_id(A).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 MATCH FILES
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /FILE=*
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /BY student_id
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /FIRST=PrimaryFirst
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /LAST=PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 DO IF (PrimaryFirst).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 COMPUTE  MatchSequence=1-PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 ELSE.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 COMPUTE  MatchSequence=MatchSequence+1.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 END IF.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 LEAVE  MatchSequence.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 FORMATS  MatchSequence (f7).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 COMPUTE  InDupGrp=MatchSequence>0.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 SORT CASES InDupGrp(D).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 MATCH FILES
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /FILE=*
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2   /DROP=PrimaryFirst InDupGrp MatchSequence.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 VARIABLE LABELS  PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id 'Indicator of each last matching case as Primary'.    
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 VALUE LABELS  PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id 0 'Duplicate Case' 1 'Primary Case'.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 VARIABLE LEVEL  PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id (ORDINAL).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id.
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 EXECUTE.
\par 
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 * Removing duplicates permanently:
\par 
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 SELECT IF (PrimaryLast_sorted_by_student_id = 1).
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 EXECUTE.
\par 
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 *There were 2 duplicate cases out of 302 cases, 300 primary cases remain after deduplication.
\par 
\par \hich\af2\dbch\af31505\loch\f2 * Task-7 [Reverse coding and adding stress_total variable]:
